craze's opencode tool profile
=============================

The tool contract in this directory -- tool ids, parameter names, types and
required lists, the model-facing descriptions in descriptions/, limits, and
result phrasing -- is ported from opencode:

    https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode
    commit 5f9d9187c01708b4e700c9c81c1045ab482bf31d (2026-09-18)
